With each significant edit or addition, add an entry to [COMMIT_MSG.txt](mdc:COMMIT_MSG.txt) describing very briefly what
was done.

For minor corrections to previous edits or additions, you do not need to add a new entry, but may
edit an existing entry *if* it has become inaccurate due to the correction.

The entry should be in point form, beginning with a hyphen. 

It should be in present active voice; for example, "Refactor blorbos for consistency" or "Adjust
spacing of ducks to reduce resource consumption". (Do not actually put these examples in the file!)